DELAY: 2000
COMMAND: TENMAPSU IOUT1?
READLINE: TENMAPSU PSUcurrent
The returned current is =  %PSUcurrent%
RANGE: %PSUcurrent% 0.233 0.010 // set the range as per TS014_TEST_SEQUENCER_scripts.docx 						
SUB: TestPassOrFail


